    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what you're saying about therapy, but it doesn't change the way it feels. it doesn't change the fact that i feel like an error code. like, if i'm just a glitch in the system, why should i even bother trying to \"fix\" myself? why bother staying in a program that's clearly broken?",
